Reject "." and ".." as SCP transfer names at any level.

The SCP sink checks the requested name only at the top level; a "." or ".."
or empty name deeper in a directory download would resolve outside the target
directory. Reject them everywhere. Carried as one line to keep the hunk's
line count.

--- a/source/core/ScpFileSystem.cpp
+++ b/source/core/ScpFileSystem.cpp
@@ -2575,1 +2575,1 @@
-          if ((Level == 0) && (OnlyFileName != UnixExtractFileName(FileName)))
+          if (((Level == 0) && (OnlyFileName != UnixExtractFileName(FileName))) || OnlyFileName.IsEmpty() || (OnlyFileName == L".") || (OnlyFileName == L".."))
